{"id": "EUVD-2026-103653", "enisaUuid": "9ccb3c95-9fce-3e5b-af73-470242fa32d3", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/virtio: fix object leak in virtio_gpu_resource_create_ioctl()\n\nvirtio_gpu_resource_create_ioctl() calls drm_gem_object_release() on the\ndrm_gem_handle_create() error path instead of dropping the reference it\nowns, so obj->funcs->free() never runs and the virtio_gpu_object, its\npages and sg table, the resource id and the host-side resource are\nleaked.\n\nUse drm_gem_object_put() instead.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:19:23", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:22:35", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d33d5ef8225538f76e4598c09e2074834667bb8d", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1586ee6107acab3b14510ac6af939f1253269df8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/83c899104496677068fbbd2e42f28fd625f9cd85", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/77dee8e9106d62bf4f51b646c801f51f8ee77339", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/574ae9fa5fd3658bee23cb544fe5a0d1d750016a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b516446a25bf365cfffe3d7884ea6637f7f70862", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/749d8bb964b3414ef967d5ec80f2f1b5b3a510d9", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/477bc3068fc3777b9d8ffd79e265b0dfdf2d3a6b"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hvjw-8jwh-8qj9", "CVE-2026-98608"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1975e9f6-8224-398b-86ca-177455253d83", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "62fb7a5e10962ac6ae2a2d2dbd3aedcb2a3e3257 <574ae9fa5fd3658bee23cb544fe5a0d1d750016a"}, {"id": "23cb9263-a8a4-3d21-bfb2-1da8eb3297ec", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "2e9ff79c-aa58-3e9a-9401-fba4f292c93a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "62fb7a5e10962ac6ae2a2d2dbd3aedcb2a3e3257 <1586ee6107acab3b14510ac6af939f1253269df8"}, {"id": "36ee2c26-2a97-33d2-9031-b649e6b35